    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your <strong>parkour</strong> skills to swiftly deliver food (and other items). Jump, dash, climb, dodge, and move with agility to complete each delivery as fast as possible. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver food and help others with special requests while discovering the unsettling truth of this animal-driven metropolis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why there's a Pig running a ramen shop? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why didn\u2019t Cato evolve like the other animals?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHERE ARE THE HUMANS?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/e8fb6725189a37d2463241d857df6166.poster.avif?t=1728680108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/e8fb6725189a37d2463241d857df6166.webm?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/e8fb6725189a37d2463241d857df6166.mp4?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode is all about speed-jump and meow. Replay your favorite routes while trying to get your name on the online scoreboard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/f7718969119fa360541a0b59bf535743.poster.avif?t=1728680108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/f7718969119fa360541a0b59bf535743.webm?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/f7718969119fa360541a0b59bf535743.mp4?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ghost Race Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our favorite mode by far, download other players' best runs and try to beat them in a classic ghost race. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/4c177ad37f76e9e875fedfdd53521d4a.poster.avif?t=1728680108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/4c177ad37f76e9e875fedfdd53521d4a.webm?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/4c177ad37f76e9e875fedfdd53521d4a.mp4?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scoreboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp your mark on the game's Scoreboard, each route has an online scoreboard to compete with other players! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/bc5ef8ffab7704f0b563150a51af4b30.avif?t=1728680108\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are you ready?</i> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Hirocato, the delivery hero.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your <strong>parkour</strong> skills to swiftly deliver food (and other items). Jump, dash, climb, dodge, and move with agility to complete each delivery as fast as possible. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver food and help others with special requests while discovering the unsettling truth of this animal-driven metropolis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why there's a Pig running a ramen shop? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why didn\u2019t Cato evolve like the other animals?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHERE ARE THE HUMANS?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/e8fb6725189a37d2463241d857df6166.poster.avif?t=1728680108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/e8fb6725189a37d2463241d857df6166.webm?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/e8fb6725189a37d2463241d857df6166.mp4?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode is all about speed-jump and meow. Replay your favorite routes while trying to get your name on the online scoreboard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/f7718969119fa360541a0b59bf535743.poster.avif?t=1728680108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/f7718969119fa360541a0b59bf535743.webm?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/f7718969119fa360541a0b59bf535743.mp4?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ghost Race Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our favorite mode by far, download other players' best runs and try to beat them in a classic ghost race. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/4c177ad37f76e9e875fedfdd53521d4a.poster.avif?t=1728680108\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/4c177ad37f76e9e875fedfdd53521d4a.webm?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/4c177ad37f76e9e875fedfdd53521d4a.mp4?t=1728680108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scoreboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp your mark on the game's Scoreboard, each route has an online scoreboard to compete with other players! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445060/extras/bc5ef8ffab7704f0b563150a51af4b30.avif?t=1728680108\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are you ready?</i> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Hirocato, the delivery hero.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Jump, dash, rewind, and deliver food on time in Hirocato - The Delivery Hero! Play as Cato, a crazy cute cat on a food delivery mission. Parkour through tricky levels, avoid obstacles, and rewind time to fix mistakes. Enjoy hand-made pixel art and great music. Can you complete every delivery?",
